:: Bailey HQ Dig Run Caught
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<maninit>>
	<<set $enemytrust -= 100>>
	<<set $enemyanger += 200>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<man>>
<<audience>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Dig Run Caught Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Dig Run Caught]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Bailey HQ Dig Run Caught Finish
<<effects>>
<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<<tearful>> you manage to beat them back and run away before they get back up.
	<br><br>
	<<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 25>><<alertnessclamp>>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Bailey HQ Barbed Wire Fence]]>><</link>>

<<else>>
	<<ejaculation>>

	You don't even get a moment to breathe before they put something over your mouth and you passout.
	<br><br>
	<<set $baileyHQ.alertness -= 10>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<passoutbaileyhq>>
<</if>>
